1
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:18,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:30,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:36,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:52,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:58,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:12,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:16,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 8]</font>

15
00:01:34,900 --> 00:01:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan?</font>

16
00:01:37,460 --> 00:01:38,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan?</font>

17
00:01:40,380 --> 00:01:41,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's Changle's men.</font>

18
00:01:42,540 --> 00:01:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are the odds?</font>

19
00:01:44,580 --> 00:01:46,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan just told me today</font>

20
00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:47,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that she'd uncover the truth for you.</font>

21
00:01:49,380 --> 00:01:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You said she wanted to clear my name?</font>

22
00:01:51,420 --> 00:01:51,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

23
00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:54,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle despises you.</font>

24
00:01:54,580 --> 00:01:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is definitely not that simple.</font>

25
00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:57,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

26
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:01,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan offended her for your sake.</font>

27
00:02:03,660 --> 00:02:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must save her.</font>

28
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:06,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What nonsense is this?</font>

29
00:02:07,540 --> 00:02:09,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She betrayed the Prince first.</font>

30
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:10,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

31
00:02:10,700 --> 00:02:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if she hadn't provoked Changle,</font>

32
00:02:12,780 --> 00:02:14,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it wouldn't have come to this.</font>

33
00:02:15,580 --> 00:02:16,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She brought this on herself.</font>

34
00:02:17,180 --> 00:02:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

35
00:02:20,340 --> 00:02:20,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

36
00:02:22,180 --> 00:02:23,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you won't save her,</font>

37
00:02:23,940 --> 00:02:25,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go myself.</font>

38
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

39
00:02:57,860 --> 00:02:58,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why is this happening?</font>

40
00:03:00,540 --> 00:03:01,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan,</font>

41
00:03:02,260 --> 00:03:03,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">still playing dumb?</font>

42
00:03:06,380 --> 00:03:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you truly think I'm a pushover?</font>

43
00:03:09,860 --> 00:03:10,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Very well.</font>

44
00:03:10,860 --> 00:03:13,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's settle old and new scores today,</font>

45
00:03:14,180 --> 00:03:16,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so you'll know the consequences
of betraying me.</font>

46
00:03:18,100 --> 00:03:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A misunderstanding!</font>

47
00:03:19,060 --> 00:03:19,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This must be a misunderstanding!</font>

48
00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

49
00:03:20,980 --> 00:03:22,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang has brought
Judicial Review officers here,</font>

50
00:03:22,740 --> 00:03:23,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">blocking the main gate.</font>

51
00:03:23,940 --> 00:03:24,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He claims</font>

52
00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they are hunting an assassin.</font>

53
00:03:28,580 --> 00:03:30,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They found me so quickly.</font>

54
00:03:31,940 --> 00:03:32,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A pity.</font>

55
00:03:32,780 --> 00:03:34,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is it not Prince Duan</font>

56
00:03:34,140 --> 00:03:35,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're so devoted to?</font>

57
00:03:37,660 --> 00:03:39,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan and I are sworn enemies.</font>

58
00:03:39,940 --> 00:03:41,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would never betray you,</font>

59
00:03:41,660 --> 00:03:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so Prince Duan would not come for me.</font>

60
00:03:43,940 --> 00:03:44,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep up the act.</font>

61
00:03:45,660 --> 00:03:46,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd like to see</font>

62
00:03:47,140 --> 00:03:48,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just how long you two can keep</font>

63
00:03:48,020 --> 00:03:49,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this little act of yours going.</font>

64
00:03:52,380 --> 00:03:53,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fuhai.</font>

65
00:03:53,580 --> 00:03:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

66
00:04:08,980 --> 00:04:09,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before I entered</font>

67
00:04:10,060 --> 00:04:11,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Court of Judicial Review,</font>

68
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:12,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it was also you who escorted me.</font>

69
00:04:13,740 --> 00:04:15,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The treatment is truly worlds apart.</font>

70
00:04:16,220 --> 00:04:17,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun,</font>

71
00:04:17,540 --> 00:04:18,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why must you</font>

72
00:04:18,500 --> 00:04:19,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">offend our Princess?</font>

73
00:04:20,260 --> 00:04:21,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were asking for trouble.</font>

74
00:04:22,740 --> 00:04:23,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tonight,</font>

75
00:04:23,740 --> 00:04:24,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no matter what you say,</font>

76
00:04:25,260 --> 00:04:27,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must send you on your way.</font>

77
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:30,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't blame me for this.</font>

78
00:04:34,060 --> 00:04:35,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

79
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:36,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing here?</font>

80
00:04:37,060 --> 00:04:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have entrusted my life to you.</font>

81
00:04:39,900 --> 00:04:40,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you die,</font>

82
00:04:42,260 --> 00:04:43,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who will answer to me?</font>

83
00:04:43,900 --> 00:04:45,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right on time.</font>

84
00:04:45,620 --> 00:04:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Princess foresaw all of this.</font>

85
00:04:48,060 --> 00:04:49,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's laid an inescapable trap.</font>

86
00:04:49,940 --> 00:04:51,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You cannot escape.</font>

87
00:04:52,740 --> 00:04:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

88
00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:55,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you used me to lure the Prince out.</font>

89
00:04:57,100 --> 00:04:58,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Princess merely made
a casual attempt.</font>

90
00:04:59,300 --> 00:05:00,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who knew Prince Duan</font>

91
00:05:00,620 --> 00:05:01,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would feel such devotion</font>

92
00:05:01,660 --> 00:05:03,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for a lowly coroner like you?</font>

93
00:05:03,620 --> 00:05:04,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan,</font>

94
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:05,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">forgive me.</font>

95
00:05:06,060 --> 00:05:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Attack!</font>

96
00:05:25,500 --> 00:05:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go!</font>

97
00:05:33,140 --> 00:05:33,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, run!</font>

98
00:05:42,380 --> 00:05:42,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, watch out!</font>

99
00:05:45,980 --> 00:05:46,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

100
00:05:46,660 --> 00:05:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

101
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:48,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

102
00:06:02,700 --> 00:06:03,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jinyu Chamber]</font>

103
00:06:14,340 --> 00:06:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Search over there.</font>

104
00:06:15,060 --> 00:06:15,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

105
00:06:33,500 --> 00:06:34,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I die,</font>

106
00:06:37,260 --> 00:06:38,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you won't live alone either.</font>

107
00:06:40,220 --> 00:06:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At a time like this,</font>

108
00:06:41,220 --> 00:06:42,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're still thinking of revenge?</font>

109
00:06:42,860 --> 00:06:44,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me check the situation.</font>

110
00:06:45,660 --> 00:06:47,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you see two people just now?</font>

111
00:06:48,100 --> 00:06:48,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That way.</font>

112
00:06:48,900 --> 00:06:49,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

113
00:06:58,460 --> 00:06:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You rogue.</font>

114
00:06:59,300 --> 00:07:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out now!</font>

115
00:07:00,580 --> 00:07:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you keep staring, I'll call for help.</font>

116
00:07:02,100 --> 00:07:02,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

117
00:07:02,740 --> 00:07:03,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Search the next room.</font>

118
00:07:08,900 --> 00:07:09,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

119
00:07:10,660 --> 00:07:11,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The way you scold people</font>

120
00:07:12,900 --> 00:07:13,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is rather endearing.</font>

121
00:07:31,820 --> 00:07:32,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

122
00:07:34,180 --> 00:07:34,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is bad.</font>

123
00:07:35,660 --> 00:07:36,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The arrow was poisoned.</font>

124
00:08:22,860 --> 00:08:24,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

125
00:08:26,500 --> 00:08:27,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has the Prince returned?</font>

126
00:08:28,180 --> 00:08:28,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, not yet.</font>

127
00:08:30,420 --> 00:08:31,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi,</font>

128
00:08:31,740 --> 00:08:33,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Prince has great fortune.</font>

129
00:08:33,420 --> 00:08:34,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Surely, nothing will happen to him.</font>

130
00:09:41,020 --> 00:09:41,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're finally awake.</font>

131
00:09:46,780 --> 00:09:48,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next time you want to play hero,</font>

132
00:09:48,860 --> 00:09:50,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">consider</font>

133
00:09:50,140 --> 00:09:51,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your own limits first.</font>

134
00:09:52,180 --> 00:09:53,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could never pay</font>

135
00:09:53,420 --> 00:09:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for your life.</font>

136
00:09:56,340 --> 00:09:57,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My aura is too fierce.</font>

137
00:09:59,140 --> 00:10:00,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">King Yama won't accept
a vengeful spirit like me.</font>

138
00:10:03,100 --> 00:10:03,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

139
00:10:05,020 --> 00:10:05,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you worried about me?</font>

140
00:10:06,660 --> 00:10:07,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's worried about you?</font>

141
00:10:08,900 --> 00:10:11,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm worried your recklessness
will get me killed.</font>

142
00:10:15,180 --> 00:10:16,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">King Yama</font>

143
00:10:18,780 --> 00:10:20,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wouldn't even want a fool like you.</font>

144
00:10:28,540 --> 00:10:29,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you save me?</font>

145
00:10:37,140 --> 00:10:37,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I admit it.</font>

146
00:10:38,740 --> 00:10:39,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Regarding the case,</font>

147
00:10:40,220 --> 00:10:41,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had my own selfish motives.</font>

148
00:10:41,820 --> 00:10:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will give you an explanation.</font>

149
00:10:43,420 --> 00:10:44,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,</font>

150
00:10:44,420 --> 00:10:46,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll go our separate ways.</font>

151
00:10:47,220 --> 00:10:48,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We owe each other nothing.</font>

152
00:11:06,420 --> 00:11:07,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly!</font>

153
00:11:07,660 --> 00:11:08,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must think of something.</font>

154
00:11:10,140 --> 00:11:10,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

155
00:11:12,900 --> 00:11:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need an explanation.</font>

156
00:11:17,180 --> 00:11:17,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

157
00:11:17,740 --> 00:11:18,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you alright?</font>

158
00:11:18,700 --> 00:11:19,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you hurt?</font>

159
00:11:20,020 --> 00:11:20,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

160
00:11:20,940 --> 00:11:23,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks to you and the Prince
working together to rescue me.</font>

161
00:11:23,660 --> 00:11:24,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did Changle give you trouble?</font>

162
00:11:24,740 --> 00:11:25,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could she trouble me?</font>

163
00:11:25,820 --> 00:11:27,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This morning,
I filed an imperial petition,</font>

164
00:11:27,340 --> 00:11:28,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">accusing her of assaulting me.</font>

165
00:11:28,900 --> 00:11:29,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you think?</font>

166
00:11:29,620 --> 00:11:30,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's what I call turning the tables.</font>

167
00:11:30,660 --> 00:11:31,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That way,</font>

168
00:11:31,620 --> 00:11:33,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd offend her completely.</font>

169
00:11:33,820 --> 00:11:34,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's put that aside for now.</font>

170
00:11:34,780 --> 00:11:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take you two inside first.</font>

171
00:11:35,940 --> 00:11:36,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

172
00:11:38,060 --> 00:11:38,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan.</font>

173
00:11:39,740 --> 00:11:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the blood-sucking monster.</font>

174
00:11:41,260 --> 00:11:42,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He still dares to come out
and cause trouble.</font>

175
00:11:42,900 --> 00:11:43,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Beat him to death!</font>

176
00:11:43,900 --> 00:11:45,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Beat him to death!
- Beat him to death!</font>

177
00:11:45,660 --> 00:11:47,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyone obstructing justice
will be flogged.</font>

178
00:11:48,020 --> 00:11:48,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's see who dares to move.</font>

179
00:11:48,820 --> 00:11:49,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't let him go.</font>

180
00:11:49,900 --> 00:11:52,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The next victim could be one of us.</font>

181
00:11:52,780 --> 00:11:55,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Beat him!
- Beat him!</font>

182
00:11:55,380 --> 00:11:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan has been wronged!</font>

183
00:11:57,500 --> 00:11:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're being used by schemers!</font>

184
00:11:59,100 --> 00:11:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When this is investigated,</font>

185
00:11:59,900 --> 00:12:00,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">none of you will escape punishment.</font>

186
00:12:01,140 --> 00:12:02,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't trust them.</font>

187
00:12:02,620 --> 00:12:03,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're all in this together.</font>

188
00:12:04,060 --> 00:12:04,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Beat him!</font>

189
00:12:04,580 --> 00:12:05,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's see who dares!</font>

190
00:12:05,220 --> 00:12:05,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Beat him!
- Beat him!</font>

191
00:12:05,740 --> 00:12:07,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Beat him!
- Beat him!</font>

192
00:12:08,020 --> 00:12:08,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop throwing things!</font>

193
00:12:09,420 --> 00:12:10,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm talking to you. Stop it!</font>

194
00:12:13,900 --> 00:12:14,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to me.</font>

195
00:12:14,340 --> 00:12:15,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You dare throw things at me?</font>

196
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:17,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Beat him!</font>

197
00:12:17,780 --> 00:12:18,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

198
00:12:20,300 --> 00:12:21,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

199
00:12:22,140 --> 00:12:22,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A monster!</font>

200
00:12:23,300 --> 00:12:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- A monster!
- Stop!</font>

201
00:12:25,700 --> 00:12:26,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

202
00:12:26,660 --> 00:12:27,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- A monster!
- Jinyi.</font>

203
00:12:29,780 --> 00:12:31,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Beat him!
- Beat him!</font>

204
00:12:33,660 --> 00:12:34,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you dare lay a hand on her,</font>

205
00:12:36,140 --> 00:12:37,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take your wretched lives.</font>

206
00:12:41,420 --> 00:12:42,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone,</font>

207
00:12:42,860 --> 00:12:43,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there is no need to fear.</font>

208
00:12:44,420 --> 00:12:45,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I give you my word.</font>

209
00:12:46,500 --> 00:12:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will get to the bottom of this case</font>

210
00:12:48,980 --> 00:12:50,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and uncover who the real monster is.</font>

211
00:12:50,540 --> 00:12:52,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will see that justice is done.</font>

212
00:12:58,260 --> 00:12:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold her down!</font>

213
00:12:59,380 --> 00:12:59,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

214
00:12:59,740 --> 00:13:00,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you lost your mind again?</font>

215
00:13:00,580 --> 00:13:01,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Glare at me again. I dare you.</font>

216
00:13:01,540 --> 00:13:02,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who told you to tie her up?</font>

217
00:13:02,460 --> 00:13:03,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I gave the order.</font>

218
00:13:04,220 --> 00:13:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan.</font>

219
00:13:05,460 --> 00:13:06,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Public opinion
is turning against us now.</font>

220
00:13:06,980 --> 00:13:08,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone is saying she is
a blood-sucking monster.</font>

221
00:13:08,740 --> 00:13:10,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I don't tie her up,</font>

222
00:13:10,180 --> 00:13:11,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who will take responsibility
if something goes wrong?</font>

223
00:13:11,660 --> 00:13:12,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi is not a monster.</font>

224
00:13:14,620 --> 00:13:15,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will interrogate her thoroughly</font>

225
00:13:16,900 --> 00:13:18,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and give you an explanation then.</font>

226
00:13:18,420 --> 00:13:20,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am the Deputy Minister
of the Court of Judicial Review.</font>

227
00:13:20,100 --> 00:13:21,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This matter is under my jurisdiction.</font>

228
00:13:21,420 --> 00:13:23,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't need a suspect
to do the interrogating.</font>

229
00:13:26,460 --> 00:13:27,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

230
00:13:27,500 --> 00:13:29,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi is from Prince Duan's Mansion.</font>

231
00:13:29,340 --> 00:13:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps</font>

232
00:13:30,020 --> 00:13:31,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we should let the Prince try first.</font>

233
00:13:31,340 --> 00:13:31,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

234
00:13:31,980 --> 00:13:32,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why are you siding with an outsider,</font>

235
00:13:32,740 --> 00:13:33,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">speaking up for him?</font>

236
00:13:33,820 --> 00:13:35,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if they conspire
to match their stories?</font>

237
00:13:35,420 --> 00:13:36,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is real cannot be faked,</font>

238
00:13:36,620 --> 00:13:37,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and what is fake cannot become real.</font>

239
00:13:39,060 --> 00:13:39,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

240
00:13:40,740 --> 00:13:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

241
00:13:41,940 --> 00:13:43,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two, come with me.</font>

242
00:14:03,820 --> 00:14:04,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop this act.</font>

243
00:14:05,700 --> 00:14:07,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know you're diverting attention.</font>

244
00:14:15,060 --> 00:14:16,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You had not returned.</font>

245
00:14:16,900 --> 00:14:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Princess Changle's people</font>

246
00:14:17,700 --> 00:14:19,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were spreading word of your absence.</font>

247
00:14:19,620 --> 00:14:20,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I guessed</font>

248
00:14:21,140 --> 00:14:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she intended to stir the people
with rumors,</font>

249
00:14:23,020 --> 00:14:24,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">using public opinion to destroy you.</font>

250
00:14:25,780 --> 00:14:27,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have no skill for solving cases.</font>

251
00:14:27,580 --> 00:14:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I cannot help clear your name.</font>

252
00:14:29,380 --> 00:14:30,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This was the only way I could think of</font>

253
00:14:31,220 --> 00:14:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to share your burden.</font>

254
00:14:33,620 --> 00:14:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi.</font>

255
00:14:35,260 --> 00:14:36,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have served me for many years.</font>

256
00:14:38,180 --> 00:14:39,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should know</font>

257
00:14:39,700 --> 00:14:40,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that what I despise most</font>

258
00:14:41,740 --> 00:14:43,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is subordinates acting
on their own authority.</font>

259
00:14:45,220 --> 00:14:46,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are no monsters here.</font>

260
00:14:47,780 --> 00:14:48,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But your actions</font>

261
00:14:49,500 --> 00:14:51,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have just created one.</font>

262
00:14:52,780 --> 00:14:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry about that.</font>

263
00:14:54,820 --> 00:14:55,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

264
00:14:56,340 --> 00:14:57,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was only worried for your safety.</font>

265
00:14:58,660 --> 00:14:59,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I acted too recklessly.</font>

266
00:15:05,460 --> 00:15:06,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why has your hair turned like this?</font>

267
00:15:09,540 --> 00:15:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I asked Physician Liu
for the Weakening Pill.</font>

268
00:15:11,620 --> 00:15:13,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Taking a certain dose will cause this.</font>

269
00:15:13,860 --> 00:15:14,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A certain dose?</font>

270
00:15:15,620 --> 00:15:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many was that?</font>

271
00:15:18,180 --> 00:15:19,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ten pills.</font>

272
00:15:21,020 --> 00:15:22,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, don't worry.</font>

273
00:15:22,580 --> 00:15:24,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Though I've lost my inner strength,</font>

274
00:15:24,260 --> 00:15:25,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can still learn martial arts.</font>

275
00:15:25,940 --> 00:15:26,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is no great matter.</font>

276
00:15:34,500 --> 00:15:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This bottle of medicine</font>

277
00:15:35,460 --> 00:15:37,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can ease your internal injuries.</font>

278
00:15:44,740 --> 00:15:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Also,</font>

279
00:15:45,980 --> 00:15:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">stop meddling in Changle's affairs.</font>

280
00:15:48,620 --> 00:15:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will deal with her properly.</font>

281
00:15:58,220 --> 00:15:58,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

282
00:15:59,500 --> 00:16:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is Jinyi?</font>

283
00:16:01,140 --> 00:16:02,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She simply took the wrong medicine.</font>

284
00:16:02,060 --> 00:16:02,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It agitated her.</font>

285
00:16:03,540 --> 00:16:04,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She has calmed down now.</font>

286
00:16:04,940 --> 00:16:06,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you take me for a fool?</font>

287
00:16:06,540 --> 00:16:07,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The wrong medicine?</font>

288
00:16:08,580 --> 00:16:09,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she is calm now,</font>

289
00:16:09,940 --> 00:16:11,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will take her back to the office.</font>

290
00:16:11,340 --> 00:16:11,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

291
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:12,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

292
00:16:13,460 --> 00:16:14,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The common folk are right outside.</font>

293
00:16:14,820 --> 00:16:15,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They are all watching.</font>

294
00:16:15,740 --> 00:16:16,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you do not hand her over,</font>

295
00:16:16,700 --> 00:16:17,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how am I to answer to them?</font>

296
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:20,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will handle the people myself.</font>

297
00:16:21,820 --> 00:16:24,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your men guard here now.</font>

298
00:16:25,260 --> 00:16:27,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I stake the mansion's honor on it.</font>

299
00:16:28,460 --> 00:16:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi will not step beyond this door.</font>

300
00:16:31,220 --> 00:16:32,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This mansion still has honor?</font>

301
00:16:33,420 --> 00:16:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll take my life.</font>

302
00:16:35,820 --> 00:16:37,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan, noble and revered,</font>

303
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:39,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would actually stake his life</font>

304
00:16:39,100 --> 00:16:40,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for a mere maid.</font>

305
00:16:40,540 --> 00:16:41,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am impressed.</font>

306
00:16:42,340 --> 00:16:43,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well then,</font>

307
00:16:43,220 --> 00:16:44,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe you will keep your word.</font>

308
00:16:46,620 --> 00:16:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two,</font>

309
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:48,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't let her out of your sight.</font>

310
00:16:48,900 --> 00:16:49,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Yes.
- Yes.</font>

311
00:16:50,060 --> 00:16:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, let's go.</font>

312
00:16:52,140 --> 00:16:52,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan.</font>

313
00:16:54,820 --> 00:16:55,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A word in private.</font>

314
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

315
00:17:02,230 --> 00:17:03,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

316
00:17:03,900 --> 00:17:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

317
00:17:07,820 --> 00:17:12,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

318
00:17:12,500 --> 00:17:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

319
00:17:16,490 --> 00:17:20,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

320
00:17:21,010 --> 00:17:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

321
00:17:25,340 --> 00:17:30,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

322
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:37,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

323
00:17:38,150 --> 00:17:41,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

324
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:46,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

325
00:17:46,750 --> 00:17:49,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

326
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:54,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

327
00:17:55,330 --> 00:17:59,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
